;; Negative fixture: arc 278 BRIEF-scalar-def-reaches-the-gate.
;;
;; A bare (unnamespaced) top-level SCALAR def — no `fn` shape. `register_defines`
;; (runtime.rs) only routes fn-shaped `def`s through `resolve::gate`; a scalar def
;; falls through to `rest` and, before this fix, never reached `gate()` at all —
;; it compiled clean. This is the NEW specimen the codemod migration in `72a1ac3d`
;; retired from the corpus (the six `wat_arc157_def_*` fixtures that used to hold
;; bare scalar defs were namespaced), so nothing else on the floor exercises this
;; hole. Must fail with `UnnamespacedName`, naming `:pi`.
(:wat::core::def :pi 3.14)
